{"id":"5b13bea8fb4eeb65","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-negation-axiom.md","title":"KF 的负子句与 FS 的经典否定子句","display":"df-truth-negation-axiom — KF 的负子句与 FS 的经典否定子句","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-negation-axiom","aliases":["91-df-truth-negation-axiom","91-df-neg-axiom"],"display":"df-truth-negation-axiom — KF 的负子句与 FS 的经典否定子句","depends_on":["[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-coded-syntax]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-negation-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-negation-axiom</span><span>91-df-neg-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-negation-axiom — KF 的负子句与 FS 的经典否定子句"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_1,\\ldots,K_{13}\">\\(K_1,\\ldots,K_{13}\\)</span> 依次指 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a> 列出的十三个编码量化公理；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(D=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{KF}},\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{FS}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{KF}},\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{FS}}\\)</span> 是下述公理集；上标标明系统，非预先假设这些系统等价。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}negation\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{KF}}\\coloneqq\\{K_2,K_3,K_5,K_7,K_9,K_{11},K_{13}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}negation\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{KF}}\\coloneqq\\{K_2,K_3,K_5,K_7,K_9,K_{11},K_{13}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{FS}}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\forall a\\,[D(a)\\to(T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(a))]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{FS}}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\forall a\\,[D(a)\\to(T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(a))]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一组包括原子不等式、双重否定、负合取、负析取、负量词及负真理原子子句，均复用 KF 的统一编码句。特别是最后一条对非句子项值还含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg D(\\operatorname{val}(t))\">\\(\\neg D(\\operatorname{val}(t))\\)</span>，不能遗漏。\n第二组是单个统一编码公理，不是仅对每个命名标准句的模式。KF 的内部否定与外部否定一般不同；FS 的公理则将其等同，但没有对全部含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 句子的真理迭代双条件。两者均在经典外部证明逻辑中表述。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 14.1；Definition 15.2，印刷页 145、186–187，PDF 页 156、197–198。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K_1,\\ldots,K_{13}$ 依次指 [[91-df-KF]] 列出的十三个编码量化公理；$D=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K_1,\\ldots,K_{13}","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{KF}},\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{FS}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}negation\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{KF}}\\coloneqq\\{K_2,K_3,K_5,K_7,K_9,K_{11},K_{13}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{FS}}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\forall a\\,[D(a)\\to(T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(a))]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg D(\\operatorname{val}(t))","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1641,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-120","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-negation-axiom]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\